quot;Exit safe preview&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;Please view the page after logging out for accurate rendering.&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Safe Preview&quot;,&quot;globalSafeMode&quot;:&quot;Embedded Code: This block contains embedded code that has been disabled.&quot;,&quot;invalidThumbnail&quot;:&quot;Custom featured images only available with embedded videos. Go back into embed settings to turn off featured images.&quot;,&quot;invalidVideo&quot;:&quot;Invalid video embed.&quot;,&quot;playButton&quot;:&quot;Play&quot;,&quot;scriptDisabled&quot;:&quot;Script Disabled&quot;}\"\n  \n  \n>\n  \n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n        \n        \n        \n          <div style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/59863761?h=51171b16d1\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script>\n<p><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/59863761\">Constellations</a> from <a href=\"https://vimeo.com/user16528275\">El Aleph Press</a> on <a href=\"https://vimeo.com\">Vimeo</a>.</p>\n        \n        \n        \n      \n    \n  \n  \n    \n\n\n\n  \n</div>\n\n\n  <style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1685404311650_1949\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1685404311650_1949\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Constellations</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This time, you know all I know,<br>the quiet sunlight wrapped<br>between two layers of cloth, the way<br>an orchid simplifies and reproduces<br>Wittgenstein’s blue notebook, even<br>this path which is not a path<br>but a shift in octaves. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All day, we did nothing<br>but prick ourselves with a pin<br>so that the prayers could pass through. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This time, you can carry everything,<br>our masks that fill the sky,<br>the stars and their histories<br>as perforation and stamen. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All day, we played a game<br>where we put our faces on<br>top of everyone else’s. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This was easy until<br>we forgot what we<br>looked like and the rules<br>became more complex. </p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1685404311650_1949 {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1685404311650_1949 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1685404311650_1949 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1685404311650_1949 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1685404311650_1949 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1685404311650_1949 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1685404311650_1949 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
  "excerpt": "Constellations is a film poem that is a part of the collaborative book Or Else They Are Trees with poetry by Michael Bagwell and artwork by Rebecca Miller, published by El Aleph Press"
